      "en_US": [
        "Hello, there!\n",
        "I am the official Name Rater!\r",
        "Want me to rate the nicknames\n",
        "of your Pokémon? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon nickname should\n",
        "I critique, kid?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That is a decent nickname!\r",
        "But, would you like me to give it\n",
        "a much better name?\f",
        "How about it? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "All right! Then, what shall the new\n",
        "nickname be?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "There! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It is a much better name than before!\n",
        "Don’t you agree?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "OK.\n",
        "Suit yourself.\r",
        "Do come visit again if you’ve changed\n",
        "your mind."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "There! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Not so different from before?\n",
        "Your eyes are tricking you!\r",
        "This one is better.\n",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm.\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}, is it?\r",
        "That is a truly impeccable name!\r",
        "Take good care of {STRVAR_1 1, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_00008",
